# Cloudflare IP ranges — offline fallback snapshot.
#
# install.sh fetches the live list from https://www.cloudflare.com/ips-v4 and
# /ips-v6 when generating a fresh Caddyfile. This bundled snapshot is used ONLY
# when that live fetch fails (e.g. a censored/slow network), so trusted_proxies
# is never left as loopback-only — which behind Cloudflare would make Caddy see
# every visitor as a Cloudflare edge IP and get those IPs banned (self-DoS).
#
# Snapshot date: 2026-08-24. Cloudflare changes these rarely; if you rely on the
# fallback, verify against https://www.cloudflare.com/ips and update if needed.
# Format: one CIDR per line; '#' comments and blank lines are ignored.

